{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[]},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["##Text-Based Decision Game\n","Create a text-based decision-making game.\n","The game should present players with scenarios where choices affect the storyline and\n","score. Multiple story paths and endings must exist.\n","The system should track decisions, compute scores, and allow replayability. String\n","processing and conditional branching are core requirements."],"metadata":{"id":"esqc-K9QZlbm"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"1ff14e2b"},"source":["### **A Simple Text Adventure Game**"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def play_game():\n","    score = 0\n","    decisions = []\n","\n","    print(\"Welcome to the Text-Based Decision Game!\")\n","    print(\"Your choices will shape your destiny and score.\")\n","\n","\n","    def scenario_one():\n","        nonlocal score\n","        print(\"\\n--- Scenario 1: The Fork in the Road ---\")\n","        print(\"You are walking through a dense forest and come across a fork in the road.\")\n","        print(\"One path is well-trodden, the other looks overgrown and mysterious.\")\n","        print(\"What do you do?\")\n","        print(\"1. Take the well-trodden path.\")\n","        print(\"2. Venture down the mysterious path.\")\n","\n","        choice = input(\"Enter your choice (1 or 2): \").strip()\n","        decisions.append(f\"Scenario 1: Chose {choice}\")\n","\n","        if choice == '1':\n","            print(\"You follow the well-trodden path. It leads you to a small, friendly village.\")\n","            score += 10\n","            print(\"Score +10 for safety.\")\n","            return scenario_two_safe\n","        elif choice == '2':\n","            print(\"You push through the overgrown bushes. You discover an ancient ruin!\")\n","            score += 20\n","            print(\"Score +20 for 