ace.\")\n","            score += 10\n","            print(\"Score +10 for caution.\")\n","            return ending_two\n","        elif choice == '2':\n","            print(\"You enter the glowing chamber. A friendly spirit teaches you an ancient spell!\")\n","            score += 25\n","            print(\"Score +25 for seeking knowledge.\")\n","            return ending_one\n","        else:\n","            print(\"Invalid choice. A trap springs, and you're stuck! Game Over!\")\n","            return None\n","\n","    def ending_one():\n","        nonlocal score\n","        print(\"\\n--- Ending 1: Hero's Welcome ---\")\n","        print(\"You successfully complete your adventure, bringing prosperity or knowledge to the world.\")\n","        print(\"You are hailed as a hero!\")\n","        score += 50\n","        return None\n","\n","    def ending_two():\n","        nonlocal score\n","        print(\"\\n--- Ending 2: Peaceful Journey ---\")\n","        print(\"You choose a path of less conflict, finding quiet satisfaction in your travels.\")\n","        print(\"You live a long and fulfilling life.\")\n","        score += 30\n","        return None\n","\n","    current_scenario = scenario_one()\n","    while current_scenario:\n","        current_scenario = current_scenario()\n","\n","    print(\"\\n--- Game Over ---\")\n","    print(f\"Final Score: {score}\")\n","    print(\"Your Decisions:\")\n","    for d in decisions:\n","        print(f\"- {d}\")\n","\n","    play_again = input(\"Do you want to play again? (yes/no): \").strip().lower()\n","    if play_again == 'yes':\n","        play_game()\n","\n","# To run the game, call the play_game() function:\n","# play_game()"],"metadata":{"id":"ayI7w-5Bugcd"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["play_game()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"t7V9nlaKDsf1","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1785314951779,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":68992,"user":{"displ